# 默认按内容自动判断文本，入库统一 LF
* text=auto

# 脚本的行尾必须固定：build.sh 带 CRLF 会报 "bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M"
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
gradlew text eol=lf

# 二进制，别让 git 试图转换或做 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.apk binary
*.jar binary
*.jks binary
*.zip binary
